research/audit/wave12-refuter-tasks/def-series-of-vectors-and-rearrangement.md-856-otherwise be a maximum over the empty index set; the algebra above needs no such
research/audit/wave12-refuter-tasks/def-series-of-vectors-and-rearrangement.md-857-restriction. The boundary in this page runs between the algebra and the metric,
research/audit/wave12-refuter-tasks/def-series-of-vectors-and-rearrangement.md:858:not where a reader would guess, and [[rem-rn-conventions-and-scope]] lists
research/audit/wave12-refuter-tasks/def-series-of-vectors-and-rearrangement.md-859-exactly which items inherit $n \ge 1$.
